# Build context excludes for the yagra-core/yagra-poller image builds (context = repo root).
# IMPORTANT: do NOT exclude `migrations/` — yagra-core embeds it at compile time via
# `sqlx::migrate!`. Keep `Cargo.toml`, `Cargo.lock`, and `crates/`.

# Rust build artifacts (regenerated in-image; huge).
target/

# VCS and tooling.
.git/
.github/

# Local-only config / internal docs (never needed in an image, keep out of layers).
# (Design/requirements docs live under .claude/docs/ — covered by .claude/ below.)
.claude/
CLAUDE.md

# Frontend deps/build (web image uses its own context + .dockerignore).
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
